  "text": "Pet Chemotherapy In Cross Lanes, WV | Cross Lanes Veterinary\n\n(304) 776-4501\n\nclvh.records@gmail.com\n\n\n\nOnline Store\nOur App\nBook Appointment\nHome\nAbout Us\nOur Team\nReviews\nPhoto Gallery\nFear Free\nCat friendly\nHospital Tour\nCareers\nContact\nServices\nWellness\nCritical Care\nSurgery\nDentistry\nUltrasound & Radiology\nEndoscopy\nView All Services\nResources\nForms\nNew Client Form\nPhoto Release Consent Form\nOur App\nFAQ\nPayment Options\nClient Information\nPuppy Information\nKitten Information\nSpecials\nBook Appointment\nWelcome New Clients!\nBook today\nand get $25 off your first exam! *\nTerms Apply\nVeterinary Services\nPet Chemotherapy\nCross Lanes Veterinary Hospital\nprovides the care and support you and your pet need amid the emotional strain of a cancer diagnosis.\nBook Appointment\nUnderstanding Pet Chemotherapy\nChemotherapy is a treatment option for pets with cancer that aims to slow the growth of cancer cells or even induce remission. Unlike in humans, chemotherapy in pets often focuses on improving quality of life rather than cure. At\nCross Lanes Veterinary Hospital,\nour goal is to provide effective treatment while minimizing side effects.\nOur\nexperienced team\nis here to provide compassionate support and high-quality care throughout your pet’s chemotherapy treatment.\nOur Approach to Pet Chemotherapy\nAt\nCross Lanes Veterinary Hospital,\nwe take a personalized approach to pet chemotherapy. Our team of veterinarians will conduct a thorough evaluation of your pet’s health in order to implement their treatment plan. We use the latest advancements in veterinary oncology to ensure the best possible outcome for your pet.\nServices We Offer\nComprehensive cancer diagnosis and staging\nImplementation of chemotherapy treatment plans\nMonitoring and management of side effects\nPain management and supportive care\nCompassionate end-of-life care\nVeterinary Services in Cross Lanes, WV\nPet Chemotherapy\nPet Dentistry\nPet Endoscopy\nPet Laboratory\nPet Laser Therapy\nPet Physical Therapy\nPet Surgery\nPet Ultrasound & Radiology\nPet Wellness\nPet Chemotherapy\nPet Dentistry\nPet Endoscopy\nPet Laboratory\nPet Laser Therapy\nPet Physical Therapy\nPet Surgery\nPet Ultrasound & Radiology\nPet Wellness\n*This promotion is valid for new clients only and may be used once per client. Cannot be combined with other offers or promotions. Other restrictions may apply.\nReady for a visit?\nServing the beloved pets of Cross Lanes, Charleston, Dunbar, St. Albans, Nitro, South Charleston, Poca, Jefferson, Hurricane, Teays Valley, and its neighboring areas with pride and joy. We are eager to give you and your animal friend a hearty welcome! Use the button below to book an appointment.\nBook Appointment\nAll pictures on our website are of actual clinic patients.\nHave a question?\nPlease get in touch with us today by completing our online form, and one of our team members will contact you shortly.\n\nContact Us\nPhone:\n(304) 776-4501\nEmail:\nclvh.records@gmail.com\n\nLocation\n524 Old Goff Mtn Rd.\nCross Lanes, WV 25313\n\nHours\nMonday-Friday:\n8 AM – 6 PM\nSaturday:\n8 AM – 12 PM\nSunday:\nClosed\nPriority Care\nMonday–Thursday, 5 PM–8 PM\nName\n*\nFirst\nLast\nEmail\n*\nPhone\nHow can we help you?\n*\nPhone\nSubmit\n© 2026 Cross Lanes Veterinary Hospital |\nPowered by PetDesk\n|\nPrivacy Policy\n|\nAccessibility Statement\nFollow\nFollow\nFollow\nFollow",
